# ============================================================================
# AI Configuration - Mac M2 Ultra Setup
# ============================================================================

# OpenAI API Key (required for GPT agent reasoning and chat)
# Get your key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...your-key-here

# ============================================================================
# Local Model Servers (running on Mac M2 Ultra)
# ============================================================================

# Embedding Server (Qwen3-Embedding-8B on port 8081)
# Started with: python -m llama_cpp.server --model ~/AI/models/qwen3-embedding-8b/qwen3-embedding-8b-q8_0.gguf --port 8081 --embedding --n_ctx 8192 --n_gpu_layers -1

# Code Generation Server (Qwen3-Coder-30B on port 8080)
# Started with: python -m llama_cpp.server --model ~/AI/models/qwen3-coder-30b/qwen3-coder-30b-instruct-q8_0.gguf --port 8080 --n_ctx 32768 --n_gpu_layers -1 --n_threads 8

# Reranker Server (Qwen3-Reranker-8B on port 8082)
# Started with: python -m llama_cpp.server --model ~/AI/models/qwen3-reranker-8b/qwen3-reranker-8b-q8_0.gguf --port 8082 --embedding --n_ctx 8192 --n_gpu_layers -1

# ============================================================================
# Notes
# ============================================================================

# The app expects all 3 local model servers to be running:
# - Port 8081: Embeddings (required for semantic search)
# - Port 8080: Code generation (optional, fallback to OpenAI)
# - Port 8082: Reranking (optional, improves search quality)

# Total memory usage: ~46GB / 128GB (Q8_0 quantization)
# - Qwen3-Coder-30B: ~30GB
# - Qwen3-Embedding-8B: ~8GB
# - Qwen3-Reranker-8B: ~8GB
